+
+Exit 0; 20,742 cases, zero mismatches, zero mutations, zero example
+failures. Full output: `02-differential.log`.
+
+## Fresh definitions and positive claims
+
+```bash
+kompile reference-semantics/semantics.k \
+  --backend llvm \
