+`04-body-sensitivity.log`.
+
+## Exhaustive inventory and fresh non-vacuity
+
+```bash
+python3 /audit-output/evidence/k_inventory.py \
+  > /audit-output/evidence/05-k-inventory.md
+python3 /audit-output/evidence/k_disposition.py \
