+## 6. Fresh non-vacuity test
+
+I did not reuse `/candidate/spec-vacuity.k`. The reviewer-authored
+[`fresh-vacuity.k`](/audit-output/evidence/fresh-vacuity.k) starts from the
+satisfying primary-entry state:
